      "MsgSerial" : 446208,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "My sister says the wyrm lay hidden deep within\r\nthe Soaring Sky Terrace.",
        "Jp" : "妹によると、ウィルムは\r\n《飛天のテラス》の奥に潜んでいたそうだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482216,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "'Tis queer, an ice wyrm dwelling amid so many\r\nbirds... Mayhap the beat of wings is a\r\ncomfort, in its way.",
        "Jp" : "あんな鳥だらけのところに\r\n氷竜がいるなんて不思議だけど、\r\nもしかすると羽ばたきの音が\r\n意外と心地よかったりするのかもね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 541928,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Mayhap I thought too much on the wyrm as if\r\n'twere a person. Anyhow, the extermination's in\r\nyour hands. No rush — tackle it when\r\nthe time feels right.",
        "Jp" : "――なんて、ちょっとウィルムのことを\r\n人みたいに考えすぎたかな\r\nとにかく、討伐の件は君に任せるよ\r\n急ぎはしないから、頃合いを見て取り組んでくれ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482218,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
